Package: vaxsurvR
Title: Management, Quality Assurance, De-Identification and Analysis of
    Vaccination Coverage Surveys
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bernard Isekah", "Osangir", , "b.osangir@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("vaxsurvR contributors", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: A reproducible, country-independent toolkit for household
    vaccination coverage surveys. Provides a configurable variable-mapping
    framework for arbitrary survey exports, structural and vaccination-specific
    data-quality checks that return machine-readable issue objects, an auditable
    cleaning trail, deterministic de-identification with disclosure control,
    complex survey design construction on top of the 'survey' package, and
    weighted coverage, zero-dose and dropout estimation with confidence
    intervals and design effects.
